            <li><strong>Data Orchestration & Engineering:</strong> Architecting massive-scale data workflows and ETL pipelines utilizing Azure Data Factory, seamlessly integrating hybrid data sources for real-time processing and analytics.</li>
            <li><strong>Infrastructure as Code (IaC):</strong> Designing reproducible, highly scalable Azure environments utilizing automated cloud provisioning to reduce overhead and eliminate deployment friction.</li>
